From: TunaOS maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] Declare direct web and Wayland protocol build dependencies

The pinned sources require libsoup for malcontent-web and Resources' soup3-sys
bindings, and spice-gtk requires the Wayland protocol definitions during
configuration. Do not rely on unrelated desktop libraries pulling these in.

--- a/elements/core-deps/malcontent.bst
+++ b/elements/core-deps/malcontent.bst
@@ -31,6 +31,7 @@ depends:
 - sdk/glib.bst
 - sdk/gtk.bst
 - sdk/libadwaita.bst
+- sdk/libsoup.bst
 - freedesktop-sdk-extra.bst:components/accountsservice.bst
 - freedesktop-sdk.bst:components/appstream.bst
 - freedesktop-sdk.bst:components/flatpak.bst
--- a/elements/core-deps/spice-gtk.bst
+++ b/elements/core-deps/spice-gtk.bst
@@ -32,6 +32,7 @@ build-depends:
 - freedesktop-sdk-extra.bst:components/python3-six.bst
 - freedesktop-sdk.bst:components/perl.bst
 - freedesktop-sdk.bst:components/sed.bst
+- freedesktop-sdk.bst:components/wayland-protocols.bst
 
 depends:
 - core-deps/phodav.bst
--- a/elements/incubator/resources.bst
+++ b/elements/incubator/resources.bst
@@ -826,6 +826,7 @@
 - freedesktop-sdk.bst:components/rust.bst
 
 depends:
+- sdk/libsoup.bst
 - sdk/adwaita-icon-theme.bst
 - sdk/glib.bst
 - sdk/gtk.bst
